OL,7,F                                       
OL,8,FI have finally completed all the bells 
OL,9,Fand whistles to make the famous WiC64  
OL,10,Fnetwork interface work on the C16/+4.  
OL,12,FI have had this working for quite a    
OL,13,Flong time by now, but I was always too 
OL,14,Flazy to prepare everything for release.
OL,16,FFirst of all, let me                   
OL,18,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,20,GI have finally completed all the bells 
OL,21,Gand whistles to make the famous WiC64  
