OL,3,GI have had this working for quite a    
OL,4,Glong time by now, but I was always too 
OL,5,Glazy to prepare everything for release.
OL,7,GFirst of all, let me address the       
OL,8,G"baaah, another modem" comments: the   
OL,9,GWiC64 is not just another modem-like   
OL,10,Gperipheral, it is rather a             
OL,11,Gfully-fledged, blazing-fast network    
OL,12,Ginterface , originally designed for the
OL,13,GC64! It can reach ~40 kb/s on the      
OL,14,GPlus/4! This video should give you an  
OL,15,Gidea of how fast it is:                
OL,17,GBitte melde Dich an, um dieses         
OL,18,GMedienelement zu sehen.                
OL,20,GThe images are C64 bitmaps converted on
OL,21,Gthe fly to the MultiBotticelli format. 
OL,22,GDon't focus on the quality of the      
OL,23,Gconversion, just think that every image
